---
import { THEMES } from '../data/themes';
import { repoDoc } from '../data/links';

const langs = ['go', 'rust', 'typescript', 'python', 'c', 'c++', 'zig', 'lua', 'ruby', 'java', 'kotlin', 'swift', 'haskell', 'ocaml', 'elixir', 'sql', 'yaml', 'toml', 'nix', 'bash', 'protobuf', 'hcl'];
const servers = ['gopls', 'rust-analyzer', 'typescript-language-server', 'pyright · ruff', 'clangd', 'zls', 'lua-language-server', 'solargraph'];
---

<section class="sec" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-id"><span class="sec-n">03</span><span>/features</span></div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Everything for reading. <em>Nothing else.</em></h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">
          The navigation you reach for a hundred times a day, done in milliseconds, in a UI that renders only
          the lines you can see.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="fgrid">
      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.01</b><span>navigate</span></div>
        <h3>Fuzzy everything</h3>
        <p>Files, symbols, and a full-tree regex scan behind three chords. Ranking favours basenames, word boundaries, and camelCase humps, the way fzf feels.</p>
        <div class="fviz keys">
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd">P</span><em>go to file</em><b>1.3 ms</b></div>
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd shift-key">Shift</span><span class="kbd">O</span><em>symbols</em><b></b></div>
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd shift-key">Shift</span><span class="kbd">F</span><em>regex scan</em><b>26.8 ms</b></div>
          <small>timings: django, 7,014 files</small>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.02</b><span>highlight</span></div>
        <h3>~280 languages</h3>
        <p>Native tokenizing through Chroma. The server lexes a 1,000-line window padded with 400 lines of context, never the whole file, and caches rendered HTML under a 512 MB LRU budget.</p>
        <div class="fviz chips">
          {langs.map((l) => <span class="chip">{l}</span>)}
          <span class="chip chip--more">+ ~258</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.03</b><span>render</span></div>
        <h3>Virtual rows</h3>
        <p>Opening a 400,000-line file costs the same as a 10-line one. Only the visible window plus 24 rows of overscan is mounted; scrolling recycles rows with a single transform.</p>
        <div class="fviz vr">
          <div class="vr-file" aria-hidden="true"><span class="vr-win"></span></div>
          <div class="vr-k">
            <span><b>400,000</b> lines in file</span>
            <span><b>~60</b> DOM rows</span>
            <span><b>0.015%</b> mounted</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.04</b><span>lsp · optional</span></div>
        <h3>Semantic when you want it</h3>
        <p>Zero-config detection of servers on your <code class="inline-code">$PATH</code>. Spawned lazily on first request, stopped on exit. Missing or crashed? Instant regex outline instead.</p>
        <ul class="fviz srv">
          {servers.map((s) => <li><i></i>{s}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.05</b><span>themes</span></div>
        <h3>14 built in</h3>
        <p>Tokyo Night by default, plus Paper, Catppuccin, Dracula, GitHub Dark, Gruvbox, Monokai, Nord, One Dark, Rose Pine, and Solarized. A theme is one CSS file of tokens.</p>
        <div class="fviz swatches">
          {THEMES.map((t) => (
            <span class="swatch" title={t.name} style={`--a:${t.vars.bg};--b:${t.vars.k};--c:${t.vars.s};--d:${t.vars.nf}`}></span>
          ))}
          <a href={repoDoc('STYLING.md')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">write your own → STYLING.md</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.06</b><span>distribution</span></div>
        <h3>One static binary</h3>
        <p>HTML, CSS, and JS are embedded with <code class="inline-code">go:embed</code>. No Electron, no Node, no CGO, no system libraries. Copy it to a box and run it.</p>
        <pre class="fviz tree"><span class="s-warn">px0</span> <span class="s-dim">static, go:embed</span>
├─ index · search · highlight · lsp
├─ web/     <span class="s-dim">html css js, ~74 KB</span>
└─ themes/  <span class="s-dim">14 × css</span></pre>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.07</b><span>memory</span></div>
        <h3>Gives memory back</h3>
        <p>After 15 seconds without requests, px0 reclaims memory. A tab left open for the afternoon costs what an idle one should.</p>
        <div class="fviz scav">
          <div><span>peak</span><i style="width:94%"></i><b>94 MB</b></div>
          <div class="hi"><span>30 s idle</span><i style="width:57%"></i><b>57 MB</b></div>
          <small>linux kernel, after five full scans</small>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fgrid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--bdr);
  }

  .fcell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 300px;
    padding: 20px 20px 22px;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }

  .fcell:hover {
    background: var(--bg-elev);
  }

  .fid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .fid b {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fcell h3 {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .fcell p {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .fviz {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  /* keys */
  .keys div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr);
  }

  .keys em {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .keys b {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .keys small,
  .scav small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  /* chips */
  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .chip--more {
    color: var(--amber);
    border-color: var(--amber-line);
  }

  /* virtual rows */
  .vr-file {
    position: relative;
    height: 30px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr-hi);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--track) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px);
  }

  .vr-win {
    position: absolute;
    top: -5px;
    bottom: -5px;
    left: 38%;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--amber);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--amber-glow);
  }

  .vr-k {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .vr-k b {
    color: var(--txt);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* lsp servers */
  .srv {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 3px 12px;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .srv li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .srv i {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--green);
  }

  /* swatches */
  .swatches {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .swatch {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--b), var(--b)) 6px 7px / 12px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(var(--c), var(--c)) 6px 12px / 8px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(var(--d), var(--d)) 6px 17px / 14px 2px no-repeat,
      var(--a);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.3);
  }

  .swatches a {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .swatches a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* pre blocks */
  .tree,
  .tty {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--txt-2);
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* scavenger */
  .scav div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0, 1fr) 52px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 4px 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .scav i {
    display: block;
    height: 10px;
    background: var(--bar-muted);
  }

  .scav .hi i {
    background: var(--bar);
  }

  .scav b {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .fgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fgrid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fcell { min-height: 0; }
    .srv { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
